    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know about being the protagonist. that sounds exhausting. i've seen what real life looks like, what it actually costs to do something meaningful, and then i come back here and see everyone just... worrying about trivial stuff. it feels like i'm from a different species. like i've already died and been sent back to a place that doesn't even make sense. it's just empty.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
